{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42791","headline":"偶有下殇因而自遣 · 刘兼","name":"偶有下殇因而自遣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彭寿殇龄共两空，幻泡缘影梦魂中。\n缺圆宿会长如月，飘忽浮生疾似风。\n修短百年先後定，贤愚千古是非同。\n南柯太守知人意，休问陶陶塞上翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}